{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "aura_transient",
  "spec": ["aura 6.17", "aura 8.2", "aura 17.11"],
  "description": "AddTransientEffect(x, z, 48 m, 10) with tract width 64 m: radius 0.75 tracts (R = 1 after half-even rounding), only the centre tract (1, 1) is inside -> +10 (simgrid 7.1); -10 at (4, 1). State 17 decays every non-zero tract by trunc(v x 0.75) per cycle: 10 -> 7 -> 5 -> 3 -> 2 -> 1 -> 0 and -10 -> -7 -> -5 -> -3 -> -2 -> -1 -> 0, sets unusedRating to 0, posts 0x2A09B21A and ends the cycle; 127 x 0.4 -> 50, -128 x 0.4 -> -51. Hand-derived (Python check).",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "aura_create"},
    {"op": "aura_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_clear_events"},
    {"op": "aura_call", "method": "add_transient_effect", "args": [100.0, 100.0, 48.0, 10.0]},
    {"op": "aura_call", "method": "add_transient_effect", "args": [300.0, 100.0, 48.0, -10.0]},
    {"op": "aura_expect_grid", "grid": "transient", "cells": [[1, 1, 10], [4, 1, -10]], "others": 0},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 17}},
    {"op": "aura_clear_events"},
    {"op": "aura_idle", "expect_state": 0},
    {"op": "aura_expect_events", "filter": {"event": "post"}, "events": [{"event": "post", "type": "0x2A09B21A"}]},
    {"op": "aura_expect_grid", "grid": "transient", "cells": [[1, 1, 7], [4, 1, -7]], "others": 0},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 17}},
    {"op": "aura_clear_events"},
